# Stable spec ID: iba-zombie. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(rum; Jamaican dark) 45 ml
(rum; gold Puerto Rican) 45 ml
(rum; Demerara) 30 ml
(lime: juice, fresh) 20 ml
(falernum) 15 ml
(Donn’s Mix) 15 ml
(grenadine syrup) 1 tsp
(bitters @ Angostura) 1 dash
(anise spirit @ Pernod) 6 drops
(ice, cracked) 170g

::equipment
(blender)
(tall tumbler)

::instructions
<add, the measured ingredients and 170g cracked ice to (blender)>
<pulse, a few seconds>
<pour, into (tall tumbler)>
<garnish, with mint leaves>

::notes
Donn’s Mix is two parts yellow grapefruit juice to one part cinnamon syrup; it is a named preparation, not automatically a brand.
Named products use bare @ unless a stronger intent is explicitly authored. No automatic substitution is implied.

